  "content": {
    "id": "p5-q13-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "13",
    "prompt": "Make $x$ the subject of each formula.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p5-q13-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$ax+b=c$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{c-b}{a}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}ax&=c-b\\\\x&=\\frac{c-b}{a}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q13-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$a(x+b)=c$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{c-ab}{a}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}ax+ab&=c\\\\ax&=c-ab\\\\x&=\\frac{c-ab}{a}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q13-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{ax+b}{c}=d$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{cd-b}{a}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}ax+b&=cd\\\\ax&=cd-b\\\\x&=\\frac{cd-b}{a}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q13-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$rx+b=tx+c$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{c-b}{r-t}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}rx-tx&=c-b\\\\(r-t)x&=c-b\\\\x&=\\frac{c-b}{r-t}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q13-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$\\sqrt{\\dfrac{x}{y}}=a$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=ya^2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x}{y}&=a^2\\\\x&=ya^2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 27
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q13-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac1x+\\dfrac1y=\\dfrac1c$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{yc}{y-c}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac1x&=\\frac1c-\\frac1y\\\\\\frac1x&=\\frac{y-c}{yc}\\\\x&=\\frac{yc}{y-c}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q13-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$m=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{n-p}{x}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{n-p}{m^2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}m^2&=\\frac{n-p}{x}\\\\m^2x&=n-p\\\\x&=\\frac{n-p}{m^2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q13-h",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "h",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{ax+b}{a^2}-\\dfrac{x+1}{b}=0$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-\\dfrac{a+b}{a}$ for $a\\ne b$.\n\nMultiply by $a^2b$, collect the $x$ terms and factorise. If $a=b\\ne0$, any real $x$ satisfies the formula.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}b(ax+b)-a^2(x+1)&=0\\\\abx+b^2-a^2x-a^2&=0\\\\abx-a^2x&=a^2-b^2\\\\ax(b-a)&=(a-b)(a+b)\\\\ax(b-a)&=-(b-a)(a+b)\\\\ax&=-(a+b)\\\\x&=-\\frac{a+b}{a}\\end{align*}$$\nThe cancellation of $b-a$ requires $a\\ne b$. If $a=b\\ne0$, the original left-hand side is zero for every real $x$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 72
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q13-i",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "i",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{y-3}{2}+1=\\dfrac{x-2}{3}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{3y+1}{2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3(y-3)+6&=2(x-2)\\\\3y-3&=2x-4\\\\2x&=3y+1\\\\x&=\\frac{3y+1}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      }
    ]
